{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15066","headline":"寄都官刘员外 · 章八元","name":"寄都官刘员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧宅平津邸，槐阴接汉宫。\n鸣驺驰道上，寒日直庐中。\n白雪歌偏丽，青云宦早通。\n悠然一缝掖，千里限清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章八元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}